title: "Supermicro Observability"
abstract: >-
  A loopback-first Prometheus and Grafana host-monitoring stack with optional
  private-link Grafana access, persistent high-frequency NVIDIA GPU sampling,
  explicit-device SMART metrics, cached fan-controller metrics, and fail-closed
  private host profiles.
type: software
authors:
